@CO	sl:i Length of segment "Stem_end" in format "trim native kraken multi flavor adapter and filter lengths"
@CO	es:Z Sequence of segment "End_loop" in format "trim native kraken multi flavor adapter and filter lengths"
@CO	et:Z Name of pattern matched in segment "End_loop" in format "trim native kraken multi flavor adapter and filter lengths"
@CO	es:Z Sequence of segment "Unrecognized_End_loop" in format "trim native kraken multi flavor adapter and filter lengths"
@CO	a3:i Start position in input of segment "trP1" in format "trim native kraken multi flavor adapter and filter lengths"
@CO	X1:i Number of other alignments with score at least 90% of this alignment's score.
@CO	XA:Z Alternative hits in the format: (chr,pos,CIGAR,NM;)*
@CO	XM:Z Methylation call string.
@CO	XG:Z Which base conversion was performed on the reference: CT or GA.
@CO	XR:Z Which base conversion was performed on the read: CT or GA.
@CO	MM:Z A count of methylated Cytosines.
@CO	SM:HG002	zz:Z0312-NA
@CO	input directories:[output, output] , channels: [1, 2]
